#. i18n: file: platform.ui:161
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, chkDisableMenuGen)
#: rc.cpp:57
msgctxt "tooltip for checkbox"
msgid ""
"This will enable automatic regeneration of Windows' Start menu entries for "
"KDE applications"
msgstr ""
"Dit maakt dat automaatsche Wedderherstellen vun Windows sien Startmenü-"
"Indrääg för KDE-Programmen an"

#. i18n: file: platform.ui:167
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, chkDisableMenuGen)
#: rc.cpp:60
msgctxt "whatsThis tooltip"
msgid ""
"This option defines if Windows' Start menu entries should be regenerated or "
"not. By default start menu entries are regenerated automaticaly, but you may "
"wish to disable it if you have issues with that."
msgstr ""
"Gifft an, wat Windows sien Startmenüindrääg wedderherstellt warrt oder nich. "
"Standardwies warrt de Indrääg wedderherstellt, man Du kannst dat ok utmaken, "
"wenn Du dor Problemen mit hest."

#. i18n: file: platform.ui:170
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkDisableMenuGen)
#: rc.cpp:63
msgctxt "checkbox caption in System Integration options"
msgid "Enable automatic regeneration of start menu entries"
msgstr "Startmenü-Indrääg automaatsch nieg opstellen"

