msgstr "Oxygen-Blinkers installeren un as Windows-Blinkerschemas bruken."

#. i18n: file: platform.ui:215
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, chkInstallCursors)
#: rc.cpp:87
msgctxt "whatsThis tooltip"
msgid ""
"This will install Oxygen cursors into your system and combine them into "
"cursor themes.<br><b>This option tweaks your Windows registry!</b>"
msgstr ""
"Dit installeert Oxygen-Blinkers op Dien Systeem un koppelt se as "
"Blinkermustern tosamen.<br><b>Disse Optschoon passt Dien Windows-Registry to."
"</b>"

#. i18n: file: platform.ui:218
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkInstallCursors)
#: rc.cpp:90
