msgstr "Oxygen-Blinkerschemas installeren"

#. i18n: file: platform.ui:225
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, chkInstallWallpapers)
#: rc.cpp:93
msgctxt "tooltip for checkbox"
msgid "This option installs KDE wallpapers into your \"My Pictures\" directory"
msgstr "Installert KDE-Achtergrundbiller binnen Dien \"Egen Biller\"-Orner"

#. i18n: file: platform.ui:228
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, chkInstallWallpapers)
#: rc.cpp:96
msgctxt "whatsThis tooltip"
msgid ""
"This will install KDE wallpapers into <i>\"My Pictures\"</i> directory so "
"that you could use them as your Windows wallpapers. If the checkbox is set "
"to half-checked then it means that there're new wallpapers available to "
"update.<br> Wallpaper aspect ratio will be selected according to your "
"current screen resolution."
msgstr ""
"Disse Akschoon installeert KDE-Achtergrundbiller binnen Dien <i>Egen Biller</"
"i>-Orner, Du kannst se denn as Windows-Achtergrundbiller bruken. Is dat "
"Krüüzfeld \"halvig\" ankrüüzt, gifft dat opfrischt Achtergrund-Biller.<br> "
"De Proportschoon vun de Achtergrundbiller warrt na Dien aktuelle "
"Schirmoplösen fastleggt."

#. i18n: file: platform.ui:231
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkInstallWallpapers)
#: rc.cpp:99
msgctxt "checkbox caption in System Integration options"
msgid "Install Oxygen wallpapers"
msgstr "Oxygen-Achtergrundbiller installeren"

#. i18n: file: platform.ui:238
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, chkStartAtLogin)
#: rc.cpp:102
msgctxt "tooltip for checkbox"
msgid "This will make essential KDE processes run at user login"
msgstr "Disse Optschoon föhrt de wichtigsten KDE-Perzessen bi't Anmellen ut"

#. i18n: file: platform.ui:241
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, chkStartAtLogin)
#: rc.cpp:105
msgctxt "whatsThis tooltip"
msgid ""
"Enabling this option will make needed KDE processes be started at user "
"login. Normally these processes are started at when you start first KDE "
"application during user session, so actual application launch is delayed."
"<br>It is recommended to enable this option to make your applications launch "
"faster for the first time.<br><b>This option tweaks your Windows registry!</"
"b>"
msgstr ""
"Maakst Du dit an, warrt de nödigen KDE-Perzessen bi't Anmellen opropen. "
"Normalerwies warrt disse Perzessen opropen, wenn Du dat eerste KDE-Programm "
"binnen Dien Törn utföhrst, man denn töövt dat Programm eerst op disse "
"Perzessen.<br>Wullt Du dat eerste Programm gauer starten, maak disse "
"Optschoon man an.<br><b>Disse Optschoon ännert Dien Windows-Registry!</b>"

#. i18n: file: platform.ui:244
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, chkStartAtLogin)
#: rc.cpp:108
msgctxt "checkbox caption in System Integration options"
msgid "Load KDE at user login"
msgstr "KDE bi't Anmellen starten"

